  "Software Details": "Detalles del programa",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Administre sin esfuerzo el menú de su restaurante con Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Mes",
  "/Year": "/Año",
  "Buy Now": "Comprar ahora",
  "View Live Demo": "Ver demostración en vivo",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Ofertas y promociones dinámicas",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Aumente sus ventas y atraiga más clientes con nuestra función de gestión de ofertas. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Arreglos de mesa eficientes",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Optimice su espacio de comedor y agilice sus operaciones con nuestra función de disposición de mesas. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Personalización y actualizaciones en tiempo real",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Adapte su menú para que se ajuste a la identidad única de su restaurante con nuestras herramientas de creación de atributos y categorías. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Compromiso del cliente mejorado",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Lleve su servicio al cliente al siguiente nivel con nuestras herramientas de gestión de clientes. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Actualizaciones de interfaz en tiempo real",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Con Dash SaaS, cualquier cambio que realice en su menú, ofertas o disposición de la mesa del comedor es visible instantáneamente en la interfaz. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "¿Por qué elegir módulos dedicados?",
